        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Company will undertake a review of the skills and qualifications of the eight (8) ESAC Bargaining Unit employees or their replacements and make appropriate conversion to the new skill codes/grouping. In no event will this special conversion result in a change in job title. A like review will be completed for future ESAC centers prior to staffing.",
            "block_bbox": [
